<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-5/8(FIM 305.15).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-5/8(FIM 305.15).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $0-3/4 lower at $60-5/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 305.15 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 7.00 markka at 312.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded on Wall Street. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 95.00 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $22-1/2 in New York on Thursday. The price equals about 113.25 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Rauma closed up 0.50 markka at 115.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
